      "text": "[5:50PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\n Currently traffic is  flowing smoothly from Cement inwards Dopemu, continuing under the bridge towards Iyana Ipaja. Similarly, the Goye intersection leading towards Alaguntan on Alimosho Road, including Akiwowo and Cash Street, which connects Moshalashi in both directions, is experiencing good traffic conditions.\n\n The Dopemu bridge towards Akowonjo roundabout, covering areas such as Sha Sha, Cele, Shobo, Kwara, Jimoh, Vulcanizer, Micom, Alaroro, Bakery, and Ogunlana junction, leading to Egbeda, is also reporting smooth vehicular movement. \n\nFor the return journey from Egbeda connecting to the Lagos-Abeokuta Expressway, traffic is moving well through Swipha, Agbotikuyo, Oniwaya, and the associated adjoining roads, with no current reports of impediments. Our personnel are presently on  ground to manage traffic flow effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
