      "text": "[6:27PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nUninterrupted traffic flow in and out of Idumota proper, with vehicles moving smoothly.\nGood traffic conditions from Tinubu Square to Nnamdi Azikiwe Street, extending down to Tom Jones Intersection.\nSmooth movement around Oyebanji Roundabout, connecting to Adeniji Adele Road through Oba's Palace and Police Post.\nGood traffic flow on the ascending route of Carter Bridge, inward-bound to Ijora Olopa and Oyingbo, as well as connections to Eko Bridge.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
